              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "LivelyLeek2917"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Used sucralose instead and doubled the peanut butter also i microwaved the p.b. to bring out flavor and then combined all ingredients except only half the whipped cream and cooked on low in a slow cooker until the mixture combines and begins to thickening. Remove from heat and combine rest of whipped cream and pour into the pie shell. Also made a topping rasberry jelly and whipped cream",
