            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Euphemist128"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Fairly easy and flavor was good. I used heated hot fudge to drizzle on the top instead of syrup to provide a chewier texture once cooled. the filling was a bit too sweet for us, so next time I am going to half the chips and increase the PB (maybe add some PB powder) and see if that helps to cut down on the cloying sweetness from the PB chips. Otherwise, a well put together recipe that's easy to follow and quick to assemble.",
            "datePublished": "2024-04-06T17:29:28.645Z"
          },
